==Portuguese==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|pt|roa-opt|prestar}}, from {{inh|pt|la|praestāre}}, present active infinitive of {{m|la|praestō}}.

===Verb===
{{pt-verb|prest|ar}}

# {{indtr|pt|para|intr=1}} to be {{l|en|useful}}; to be {{l|en|suitable}}; to be {{l|en|good}}
#: {{ux|pt|Este dicionário não '''presta'''.|This dictionary '''isn't useful'''.|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|pt|Este dicionário não '''presta''' para nada.|This dictionary '''isn't useful''' for anything.|inline=1}}
# {{lb|pt|transitive}} to {{l|en|render}}, to {{l|en|provide}}, to {{l|en|offer}} {{gloss|a service, help etc.}}
#: {{ux|pt|Ninguém me '''prestou''' ajuda.|Nobody '''offered''' me help.|inline=1}}
# {{lb|pt|transitive}} to {{l|en|pay}} {{gloss|attention, respect etc.}}
#: {{ux|pt|Acorda e '''presta''' mais atenção!|Wake up and '''pay''' more attention!}}
# {{indtr|pt|.pronominal|a}} to be {{l|en|suitable}}
#: {{ux|pt|A sala '''presta-se''' perfeitamente a este fim.|The room '''is''' perfectly '''suitable''' for this purpose.}}

